The keystone references (passport_ref, mandate_ref, policy_bound_ref, decision_ref,
execution_ref, trust_query_ref) and the canonicalisation discipline
(urn:x402:canonicalisation:jcs-rfc8785-v1, JCS / RFC 8785 plus SHA-256) are specified in the
AlgoVoi IETF Internet-Drafts (draft-hopley-x402-canonicalisation-jcs-v1 and
draft-hopley-x402-retention-chain) and documented at https://docs.algovoi.co.uk.

These adapters map the keystone execution_ref into third party formats: OpenTelemetry GenAI
semantic conventions, CloudEvents, the W3C Verifiable Credentials Data Model, and the Model
Context Protocol. Those specifications are works of their respective authors; these adapters
reference them and are not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
